Subject: [PATCH] wifi7: validate firmware replies and retire inactive BSS state

Preserve firmware rejection codes through both command transports, validate
reply lengths, retire cached profiles after group removal, and leave empty
optional MAC overrides to EEPROM defaults. Legacy AP mode is a valid BSS type.
Guard the cfg80211-only country OID when building the WEXT data path.
Stop failed PP/VOW fragments from being masked by subsequent sends and
include the rejected subcommand or requested VOW tags in failure diagnostics.

--- a/mt_wifi/chip/mcu/andes_core.c
+++ b/mt_wifi/chip/mcu/andes_core.c
@@ -993,6 +993,10 @@
